# Binance USDT-M Perpetual Futures Algorithmic Trading Platform

A modular, production-style cryptocurrency algorithmic trading platform for Binance USDT-M Perpetual Futures built with Python, FastAPI, asyncio, SQLAlchemy, and PostgreSQL/TimescaleDB.
